WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.940
I'm starving.

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.770
Who's on lunch duty today?

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:11.910
<i>Damn...</i>

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.860
<i>Why did I say that?</i>

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:15.860
<i>Hey!</i>

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.830
<i>Nakamura is pretty strange,</i>

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.870
<i>but that doesn't make her guilty of this!</i>

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.920
<i>There's no proof!</i>

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:26.680
<i>I should have ignored them.</i>

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.810
<i>That was stupid of me.</i>

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.420
<i>Don't tell me that</i>

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.220
<i>you have a crush on Nakamura?</i>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.220
<i>Dude, Kasuga...</i>

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.050
<i>Why Nakamura?</i>

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.050
<i>That's sad...</i>

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.840
<i>You've gotta be kidding!</i>

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:42.430
<i>They're all just a big herd 
of dumb, slovenly seals.</i>

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:47.540
<i>That's why I've always shut myself 
in the classroom like a mollusk.</i>

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:53.320
<i>Saeki-san also gave me a funny look.</i>

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.420
<i>It's all Nakamura-san's fault.</i>

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.540
<i>It's her fault I couldn't act as I normally do!</i>

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.080
Kasuga-kun...

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:12.230
<i>Huh?</i>

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.810
<i>Saeki-san...</i>

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:15.630
<i>Huh?</i>

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:21.220
Um, there's something I wanted to say to you...

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:22.920
<i>Say to me...</i>

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.750
<i>Say to me?</i>

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.460
<i>This is very, very bad.</i>

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:27.270
<i>Huh?</i>

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.080
This morning, you defended Nakamura-san.

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:35.360
I didn't know you had that in you.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.000
I was impressed, Kasuga-kun.

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:50.860
I don't think Nakamura-san did it, either.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.050
That's all.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:35.130
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:35.130
<b>Episode 4 of 13</b>

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.710
You have a contract with me.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.960
Are you heading home, Kasuga-kun?

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:19.800
Look out!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.720
I'll read books, and pull myself together!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.220
Hold on... Why?

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.220
No questions.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:26.850
Got it?

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:28.480
I don't get it...

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.430
No, I refuse!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.130
<i>I was impressed, Kasuga-kun.</i>

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.120
Kasuga-kun...

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:11.690
Kasuga-kun!

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:12.640
Eh?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.490
Why are you grinning like a fool?

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:17.110
It's creepy.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:17.980
Huh?

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.010
Oh, uh...

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.080
It must have been awful this morning.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.840
They called you a thief based 
only on their own speculation.

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.710
Our classmates really are despicable.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:41.880
I probably shouldn't have spoken up,

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.720
but I'm glad you didn't get in any trouble.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.090
Huh?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.850
Kasuga-kun, are you hiding something?

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:57.620
You have a contract with me.

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:02.190
That means you have to tell me everything.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:03.780
Everything.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.030
So?

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.680
I'm not hiding anything.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:13.700
Why would I hide something?

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.950
Come on...

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:23.720
Fine.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.220
Takao!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:36.880
I told you yesterday to call 
if you're going to be late!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.770
We ate dinner without you tonight!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.240
I'm sorry.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.120
A lot's going on, and I forgot.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.830
What are you smirking about?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.360
You owe me an explanation!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.100
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.250
I'm so sorry!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.410
What?

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.110
Takao?

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.830
He must be at that age.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:14.010
<b>Your hair is a rose
Your scent is a blue sunset
My sins, ever beyond salvation,
By your transparent prism,
Are easily swept away
I will change
And strike a new match</b>

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.580
All done.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.120
<i>I was impressed, Kasuga-kun.</i>

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.320
Saeki-san,

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:41.080
I will never take your uniform out again.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.970
I will never smell it again.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.960
I will not do anything to add to my offenses.

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:52.190
I'm sorry, Saeki-san.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.400
Thank you for saving me.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:33.400
Hey, Yamada.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.770
Morning.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.210
Eh?

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.730
Kasuga!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.020
Aren't you going to say hello to Nakamura?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.730
They're a perfect match...

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.170
I know what you mean.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:00.120
I see...

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.440
So that's how it is.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.530
<i>Don't let it bother you...</i>

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.930
<i>Focus on the story!</i>

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:27.700
<i>Focus!</i>

00:08:29.850 --> 00:08:30.780
Good morning.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:32.490
Huh?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.520
Wait, what was that about, Nanako?

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:40.720
What? I was just saying hello.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.800
<i>Saeki-san...</i>

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.230
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.480
<i>Kasuga-kun, are you hiding something?</i>

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:16.300
<i>I'm not sure how perceptive Nakamura-san is...</i>

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.160
<i>Did she notice?</i>

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:22.180
<i>I should go to the usual place and explain.</i>

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.910
<i>No, wait.</i>

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:28.260
<i>Why am I so worried?</i>

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:30.560
<i>What does it matter?</i>

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:33.850
<i>I can be friends with Saeki-san if I want.</i>

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:34.920
<i>That's right!</i>

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:40.750
<i>Saeki-san said good morning to me...</i>

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.860
Are you heading home, Kasuga-kun?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.780
S-Saeki-san...

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:54.860
What are you doing?

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.300
Oh,

00:09:56.300 --> 00:10:00.260
a teacher asked me to take this to 
the social studies storage room.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.040
W-Want some help?

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:07.380
Thank you.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.420
<i>God...</i>

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.260
<i>Thank you for this moment.</i>

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.810
Um, sorry for making you carry everything.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:23.850
Is it heavy?

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:26.070
It's fine...

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.430
No problem at all!

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:35.590
Uh, what do you usually do?

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:36.620
Usually?

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.780
Like after school, or on days off.

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:43.780
Let's see...

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.290
I usually study, I guess.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.820
Four days a week, I have a tutor who comes over.

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:53.790
I also take piano lessons and walk my dog.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.530
Really...

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.730
That's amazing.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.920
It must be difficult.

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:05.990
Honestly, I sometimes wish I 
could have fun more often.

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:10.900
One crow.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.600
Two crows.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.140
Three crows.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.480
Four crows.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.980
Five crows.

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.070
He's late.

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.720
How about you, Kasuga-kun?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.790
What do you usually do?

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.650
Huh? Oh, I...

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:32.640
Uh, well...

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.230
I go to the bookstore a lot.

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.440
The bookstore?

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:39.080
Yeah, I love books!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:44.200
There's a really nice used bookstore 
at the crossroads on Main Street.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:47.760
My dad said it has books you 
can't even find in Tokyo.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:49.540
Oh, really?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.060
That sounds interesting.

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.470
Wanna go?

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:00.860
Huh?

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.650
Wanna go together?

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:05.700
We could go on Sunday.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:13.640
Look out!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:27.780
Sure.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:33.480
Sure, I'll go on Sunday.

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:35.700
Huh?

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.100
<i>Wait...</i>

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.360
<i>Let's just...</i>

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.280
<i>Let's just calm down and think this over again.</i>

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:36.260
<i>Stay composed, and look at this objectively.</i>

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:41.530
<i>Saeki-san agreed to go on 
a date with me today.</i>

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.420
<i>That's right...</i>

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.340
<i>Saeki-san herself!</i>

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.010
<i>I'm bursting with joy right now!</i>

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.680
<i>But...</i>

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:54.420
<i>Nakamura-san saw us.</i>

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.640
<i>The one person I never wanted to find out...</i>

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.090
A book!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.430
I need to read a book!

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.380
I'll read a book, and pull myself together!

00:14:57.510 --> 00:15:01.060
How did you know where I live?

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:02.420
Hey, wait...

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.580
Let's go for a walk.

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:21.520
<i>Why hasn't Nakamura-san said anything?</i>

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.360
<i>Is she angry?</i>

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.610
Kasuga-kun...

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:38.450
So you have a date with Saeki-san on Sunday?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.700
<i>She's angry.</i>

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.510
<i>At what?</i>

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:48.460
<i>At me?</i>

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.950
U-Uh...

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:55.590
<i>I-Is she jealous?</i>

00:15:56.120 --> 00:16:00.480
<i>Does Nakamura-san actually... like me?</i>

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.440
Way to go!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:10.440
Huh?

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:12.730
Are you happy? Excited?

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:14.040
Nervous?

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:17.620
Huh? Uh... Yeah...

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:19.640
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.380
Thanks...

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:22.910
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.830
When and where are you meeting?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:30.510
At ten, in front of school...

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:34.130
Then, meet me thirty minutes beforehand.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:35.930
Bring Saeki-san's gym clothes.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.240
Huh?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.970
Hold on... Why?

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.990
No questions.

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:42.600
Got it?

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.430
I don't get it...

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:46.060
No, I refuse!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:56.160
Th-That hurts...

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.950
If you don't bring them, you'll regret 
it for the rest of your life.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.830
I won't make you do anything bad.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.960
Good night, then.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:31.400
<i>I swore</i>

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:35.650
<i>that I'd never take this out again...</i>

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:41.450
<i>Hell awaits if I don't take them.</i>

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:44.360
<i>Hell awaits if I do take them.</i>

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:50.670
Kasuga-kun.

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.420
Over here.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.160
Go inside.

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:01.850
Huh?

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.780
Wait, this is the girls' restroom.

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:05.090
Hurry up.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.860
Come on, go inside.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.860
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:16.570
Kasuga-kun, you brought them, right?

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.170
Put them on, under your clothes.

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:28.670
Kasuga-kun, you're going to wear 
Saeki-san's gym clothes

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.000
on your date today.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:31.920
You must be thrilled.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.170
You said you wouldn't make 
me do anything bad...

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.550
No, I refuse!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:41.640
Put them on, you sicko piece of shit.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:47.600
Nakamura-san, you're angry, aren't you?

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:51.440
Angry? Me? Why would I be?

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:54.480
Just say it...

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:58.460
You're probably jealous because 
Saeki-san and I are getting along.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:01.320
That's why you're making me do this.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.660
I'm sorry.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.650
I'm... I'm in love with Saeki-san!

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:09.540
Please... Let me go on a normal date!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.300
What the hell?

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:27.890
Don't make a fool of me, shithead.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.280
I'm jealous?

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:34.520
Did you hit your head or something? Huh?

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:36.610
I just want to see...

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:41.140
I'm dying to see a real sicko in action!

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:44.740
A true sicko, capable of burning 
down this whole town!

00:19:57.720 --> 00:19:58.950
Fine, then.

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:04.740
I'll expose you...

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:10.360
I'll expose everything under that mask of yours.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.620
If you get the picture, then put it on.

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:17.690
Put on the gym uniform 
you stole from Saeki-san.

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:35.090
Kasuga-kun.

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:38.090
Sorry, were you waiting?

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.120
No, not at all...

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:46.410
Not a bit.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.010
I'm glad the weather's so nice today.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.380
Yeah...

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:05.260
So, what do you want to do?

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:06.110
Huh?

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:09.200
Well...

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:13.450
Wanna go to the used bookstore I mentioned?

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:14.940
Uh-huh.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.850
<i>I'll expose everything under that mask of yours.</i>

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:40.510
<i>Inside my head, Nakamura-san's words</i>

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:42.510
<i>continued to spin around.</i>

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:25.860
I'm wearing Saeki-san's gym uniform right now.

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:24.510
I never knew this town had a place like this.

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:25.360
You seem to be enjoying yourself.

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:28.660
You really like books, huh, Kasuga-kun?

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:28.660
It's all over your body right now.

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:29.820
I'll forget about Baudelaire's <i>Flowers of Evil</i>.

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:30.230
Thank you for today.

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:31.330
The inside of your head is a mess.

00:23:29.820 --> 00:23:30.970
You're wrong!

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:32.610
I'm happy...

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:33.200
I'm not a pervert!

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:36.060
Admit that you're a twisted pervert.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Thank you for watching. 
I am a shithead.
